WEBVTT

00:01.730 --> 00:04.480
It's so hot here.

00:04.780 --> 00:06.490
Why is it so hot?

00:06.820 --> 00:10.490
The irregular changes
in weather patterns got worse.

00:11.200 --> 00:13.990
Even the night feels so hot.

00:14.490 --> 00:19.000
What has happened
to my cozy Subspace?

00:38.390 --> 00:44.570
TSUKIMICHI -MOONLIT FANTASY- SEASON 2

01:49.380 --> 01:51.050
NIGHT 7: THE AUDITION

01:51.050 --> 01:53.220
NIGHT 7: THE AUDITION
With help from every race,

01:53.220 --> 01:54.970
the house is finally complete.

01:54.970 --> 01:56.970
Is this my house?

01:58.810 --> 02:01.890
Welcome home, Young Master!

02:01.890 --> 02:03.640
I'm... I'm home.

02:04.150 --> 02:06.610
Welcome home, Young Master!

02:06.610 --> 02:10.400
People from the Subspace
are waiting for your return.

02:10.400 --> 02:12.650
We've been so excited to see you again.

02:12.650 --> 02:15.470
Do the honor and raise a toast.

02:17.490 --> 02:19.830
It's been a while, everyone.

02:19.830 --> 02:22.500
Thank you for this beautiful house.

02:22.870 --> 02:26.420
To reward your hard work...

02:27.420 --> 02:28.880
Well...

02:28.880 --> 02:32.340
Cheers!

02:35.110 --> 02:36.180
Unbelievable.

02:36.180 --> 02:39.470
You've been so busy
with your teaching and business.

02:39.470 --> 02:41.640
Everyone here missed you.

02:41.640 --> 02:43.940
Please come back more often.

02:45.020 --> 02:47.230
You're right.
I'll keep that in mind.

02:47.230 --> 02:49.150
Young... Young Master.

02:49.570 --> 02:51.110
If you don't mind, try this out.

02:51.650 --> 02:53.090
Thanks, Mio.

02:53.510 --> 02:55.910
This looks very similar
to what I had in Tsige.

03:01.080 --> 03:03.960
I like this.
It's so tasty.

03:03.960 --> 03:05.150
Is this...

03:07.540 --> 03:10.090
That's Mio's cooking.

03:10.570 --> 03:13.920
Up until recently, she had been
on a journey to hone her cooking skills.

03:14.550 --> 03:17.180
She prepared all the food you see here.

03:17.180 --> 03:18.390
Wow.

03:18.890 --> 03:20.550
Well done, Mio.

03:20.550 --> 03:21.640
The food is delicious.

03:23.930 --> 03:25.390
Young Master.

03:25.850 --> 03:29.190
I've come to understand
the fun of cooking.

03:29.190 --> 03:31.860
I'll prepare something even
more delicious next time.

03:32.190 --> 03:34.320
That's right!
Even more tasty!

03:35.900 --> 03:37.280
Erm...

03:37.910 --> 03:39.660
Where is Mio going?

03:39.660 --> 03:41.910
To Tsige, probably.

03:41.910 --> 03:45.040
There is an adventurer
who is skilled in making rare delicacies.

03:45.550 --> 03:46.690
I see.

03:46.690 --> 03:49.500
Whatever the case is,
I'm glad she is learning new things.

03:50.420 --> 03:52.800
Thanks for putting up with her.

03:53.360 --> 03:54.420
Now...

03:54.420 --> 03:55.670
- We have a meeting
- Young Master!

03:55.670 --> 03:57.550
- about the recent investigation.
- Talk to us too!

03:57.550 --> 03:59.220
Until then, get some rest.

04:00.890 --> 04:03.050
Tonight is going to be a long night.

04:05.430 --> 04:06.560
Let's begin.

04:07.310 --> 04:08.490
I investigated the area

04:08.490 --> 04:11.650
where you and the dragon slayer fought.

04:13.190 --> 04:15.830
MAKING LIGHT OF IT
I also ran into a hero party.

04:16.940 --> 04:19.200
He is the hero of the Gritonia Empire.

04:19.200 --> 04:21.490
The name was Tomoki Iwahashi.

04:21.490 --> 04:24.990
Judging by the looks of it,
he was around your age.

04:24.990 --> 04:26.870
Around my age...

04:27.750 --> 04:29.040
What do you think about him?

04:29.500 --> 04:33.010
It felt like he was up to no good.

04:33.010 --> 04:35.000
Hmm... In other words,

04:35.710 --> 04:36.880
he is a scum.

04:36.880 --> 04:38.260
Isn't he the hero?

04:38.610 --> 04:40.430
He is obsessed with his power.

04:40.430 --> 04:42.720
His desires got the better of him.

04:42.720 --> 04:44.060
After defeating the demons,

04:44.060 --> 04:47.600
he will likely wage war on the humans.

04:47.970 --> 04:48.850
On the other hand,

04:48.850 --> 04:51.350
I read the princess's thoughts
and noticed that she knew

04:51.980 --> 04:54.590
about the weapon known as a gun.

04:55.690 --> 05:00.070
The hero of Gritonia probably told
the humans what a gun looked like.

05:00.450 --> 05:03.020
This weapon isn't as powerful as a spell,

05:03.020 --> 05:05.130
but a small gun can be used
for assassination.

05:05.130 --> 05:07.580
Depending on the situation,
it can be used for genocide.

05:08.080 --> 05:11.580
Honestly, I find them repulsive.

05:12.040 --> 05:14.840
I even thought about taking them out
without telling you.

05:14.840 --> 05:15.550
You sound scary!

05:16.090 --> 05:19.050
You can't kill people simply
because they upset you.

05:19.050 --> 05:21.050
Let's wait and observe.

05:22.010 --> 05:25.970
Then, we'll discuss the goddess's power
and the dragon slayer.

05:26.600 --> 05:30.060
Sorry, but I never obtained
any useful information about them.

05:30.060 --> 05:31.520
Anything about myself?

05:31.880 --> 05:33.990
Well, about that...

05:33.990 --> 05:35.480
Nothing unusual for the time being.

05:36.150 --> 05:40.950
All I know is that someone caused
a huge commotion after the battle.

05:41.530 --> 05:46.660
Someone released an arrow on
the battlefield and created a lake.

05:46.660 --> 05:47.910
A lake?

05:48.290 --> 05:50.290
What kind of monster could've done that?

05:50.290 --> 05:53.170
Is this the doing of that cursed goddess?

05:54.790 --> 05:55.630
What's so funny?

05:56.000 --> 05:58.340
Sorry. I was rude.

05:58.340 --> 06:01.590
You know what?
They called the culprit "the devil."

06:01.920 --> 06:03.530
A devil?

06:04.220 --> 06:07.010
Well then,
it's our turn to deliver the reports.

06:07.640 --> 06:11.480
I got a general idea about
the academy from Shiki.

06:11.850 --> 06:14.520
It's said that you were
quite popular among girls.

06:15.400 --> 06:18.980
That's not worth reporting.

06:18.980 --> 06:20.860
Of course it is.

06:20.860 --> 06:23.780
I'd like you to tell me the details.

06:24.110 --> 06:26.030
But Shiki told you everything.

06:26.030 --> 06:27.240
This won't be necessary.

06:27.700 --> 06:29.370
More importantly...

06:29.370 --> 06:30.410
What's wrong?

06:31.200 --> 06:33.330
What is this heat I'm feeling?

06:33.330 --> 06:34.670
Yes, that's strange.

06:36.790 --> 06:38.710
This heat is unbearable.

06:38.710 --> 06:40.500
What happened here?

06:40.500 --> 06:45.380
Emma told me about the irregular
weather pattern in the Subspace.

06:46.140 --> 06:50.140
There are reports of children
and elderly people feeling unwell.

06:50.430 --> 06:53.100
The reason is likely...

06:54.140 --> 06:55.060
Me?

06:55.060 --> 06:56.060
Correct.

06:56.450 --> 07:02.450
More precisely speaking,
it is the misty door you set up outside.

07:03.780 --> 07:06.320
I set up one wherever I go.

07:06.320 --> 07:12.870
The last location where the door is used
will determine the weather in here.

07:13.410 --> 07:16.040
But the academy is pretty cool.

07:16.540 --> 07:20.750
Perhaps it's not a direct reflection
of the door's location.

07:20.750 --> 07:23.800
Terrain and landscape
could affect it as well.

07:24.590 --> 07:28.640
I'll keep investigating the effects
of the door's last location

07:28.640 --> 07:30.510
on the Subspace.

07:31.010 --> 07:34.520
To think my whereabouts
could affect the weather patterns...

07:34.990 --> 07:37.850
That means I'll never get to travel
with an ease of mind.

07:38.270 --> 07:39.810
Why?

07:40.230 --> 07:41.900
Tell me why!

07:41.900 --> 07:42.990
Sorry.

07:42.990 --> 07:46.070
The people in Limia who took great
care of us ordered us to return.

07:46.490 --> 07:47.780
But that's...

07:47.780 --> 07:51.580
I finally made the Young Master happy
after all this time.

07:51.580 --> 07:55.040
Sorry, but we have other
business to tend to.

07:55.750 --> 07:58.000
There's something I must do.

07:59.580 --> 08:03.210
I'd really love to learn more
about cooking from you.

08:03.210 --> 08:04.960
But, I guess it can't be helped.

08:04.960 --> 08:05.970
Ms. Mio...

08:07.170 --> 08:11.310
the conditions in the wilderness
are harsher than expected.

08:11.760 --> 08:13.640
Had we not run into you that day,

08:13.640 --> 08:15.930
none of us could've survived.

08:18.480 --> 08:20.730
I can't thank you enough for that.

08:21.440 --> 08:24.150
Don't mention it.
I was glad to help.

08:24.510 --> 08:29.410
But Mr. Velen made
an amazing sword for me.

08:29.410 --> 08:33.620
You will master that new toy
in no time.

08:35.580 --> 08:37.370
Ms. Mio.

08:37.370 --> 08:38.500
Will you come with me?

08:38.500 --> 08:39.590
Not a chance.

08:39.590 --> 08:40.710
You didn't hesitate.

08:41.250 --> 08:43.770
I already have the Young Master
by my side.

08:43.770 --> 08:46.380
In that case, ask him to come along.

08:46.380 --> 08:49.430
No. He is a busy man.

08:50.010 --> 08:55.190
Not even if my request concerns
the fate of the world?

08:55.190 --> 08:58.000
I don't care what happens to the world.

08:58.000 --> 09:00.190
The Young Master is
the only thing I care about.

09:00.580 --> 09:02.270
Is there no way I can convince you?

09:02.270 --> 09:03.520
No way.

09:04.940 --> 09:07.110
You totally ditched me.

09:07.110 --> 09:10.990
I don't plan to serve anyone
except the Young Master.

09:11.330 --> 09:13.910
Yes. I get it.

09:13.910 --> 09:16.450
Hibiki, stay safe on the trip.

09:16.830 --> 09:17.750
Yes.

09:17.750 --> 09:21.580
Ms. Mio, come by Limia
when you have the chance.

09:21.580 --> 09:24.880
I'll try to recall the other recipes.

09:24.880 --> 09:27.920
Oh my, that is a tempting offer.

09:28.670 --> 09:30.380
I'll hold you to that.

09:39.100 --> 09:40.600
Beautiful!

09:40.600 --> 09:42.980
As per your order,

09:42.980 --> 09:45.520
we planted lotuses
and white clovers here.

09:46.270 --> 09:48.710
This helps with the land's fallow period

09:48.710 --> 09:50.990
and provides a great place
for the children to play.

09:51.570 --> 09:53.990
The harvest has become
more bountiful as well.

09:53.990 --> 09:56.830
We improved the farmland based on
Mr. Shiki's instructions.

09:57.370 --> 10:01.290
We get to harvest the produce
once every two weeks now.

10:01.580 --> 10:03.900
The result is a bit over the top.

10:04.500 --> 10:06.010
Impressive, Shiki.

10:06.010 --> 10:08.380
I merely based the technique
on the knowledge you gave

10:08.380 --> 10:11.790
and told them to utilize the earth magic.

10:12.270 --> 10:14.470
We won't have to worry
about any food shortage.

10:15.550 --> 10:18.850
I'm still a bit concerned
about the unstable weather,

10:18.850 --> 10:22.480
but we'll proceed with the original plan
and increase the population.

10:22.480 --> 10:23.310
Very well.

10:23.310 --> 10:25.980
The selection process has begun.

10:26.770 --> 10:31.740
Lady Tomoe, Lady Mio, and Mr. Shiki
will each recommend a race.

10:32.240 --> 10:33.110
Thanks.

10:33.610 --> 10:36.450
I'd like to interview them
before I leave.

10:36.450 --> 10:37.810
I'll make the arrangements.

10:38.280 --> 10:40.450
I should also mention that Mr. Eld...

10:44.920 --> 10:45.790
What is this?

10:46.130 --> 10:52.310
This thing was brought here
after Mio tore her kimono not long ago.

10:52.800 --> 10:54.260
Mio's kimono was torn?

10:54.830 --> 10:55.470
Yes.

10:55.740 --> 10:57.680
The back of the kimono was cut.

10:57.680 --> 11:00.600
Thankfully, she wasn't hurt at all.

11:01.520 --> 11:04.100
The problem here is this material.

11:04.100 --> 11:05.850
Was it a powerful beast?

11:06.210 --> 11:08.230
I did a thorough examination.

11:08.230 --> 11:12.280
It was a monster
that consumed wind spirits.

11:12.280 --> 11:13.820
A spirit eater?

11:14.190 --> 11:17.490
Given the strength of
the average monsters,

11:17.490 --> 11:21.580
it'd be hard to prey on
even the weak spirits.

11:21.850 --> 11:23.160
Therefore...

11:23.160 --> 11:25.610
Someone unleashed the monster.

11:26.100 --> 11:27.250
So...

11:28.040 --> 11:29.020
What's wrong?

11:29.630 --> 11:31.340
It... It was me.

11:32.670 --> 11:33.210
Meaning?

11:33.840 --> 11:36.260
That monster was mine...

11:38.470 --> 11:40.260
That was before I met you.

11:40.260 --> 11:45.180
It was an experiment I did
when I was hiding in the Forest Ogres.

11:45.720 --> 11:48.270
I captured a few mid-tier wind spirits

11:48.270 --> 11:51.980
and weakened them before
letting my monster prey on them.

11:53.780 --> 11:57.990
I wanted to see if the monster
would turn into a spirit

11:57.990 --> 12:00.240
or something along the line.

12:00.660 --> 12:02.830
However, the experiment was a failure.

12:02.830 --> 12:04.120
So you just abandoned it?

12:04.120 --> 12:06.370
ABANDONED HIS TEST SUBJECT
I'm terribly sorry!

12:06.370 --> 12:08.080
By the way, was that the only experiment

12:08.420 --> 12:10.080
you did back then?

12:10.080 --> 12:12.540
No. I ran several experiments.

12:13.670 --> 12:15.460
And not just on the insect-type monsters,

12:15.460 --> 12:17.510
but shellfish-type monsters as well.

12:17.970 --> 12:19.470
Shellfish-type...

12:20.430 --> 12:21.510
Oh, that giant grab.

12:21.840 --> 12:23.290
Tomoe ate one.

12:24.430 --> 12:26.850
Pardon me,

12:26.850 --> 12:29.480
but how should we report this
to Lady Tomoe and Lady Mio?

12:30.230 --> 12:32.250
Let them give you an earful for that.

12:32.730 --> 12:34.980
Your action was indeed very wrong.

12:35.280 --> 12:37.400
I understand...

12:37.400 --> 12:40.530
A predicament
the sloppy Shiki never expected.

12:43.280 --> 12:46.370
Are we interviewing the new race today?

12:46.370 --> 12:46.950
Yes.

12:47.290 --> 12:51.750
The selection criteria include
dietary habits, cultural lifestyles,

12:51.750 --> 12:55.000
social skills, and special abilities.

12:55.000 --> 12:57.210
Lady Tomoe chose a rare race.

12:57.210 --> 12:58.880
Lady Mio chose with her intuition.

12:58.880 --> 13:02.090
Mr. Shiki chose based on
their competence.

13:03.390 --> 13:05.220
I'm a little bit concerned.

13:05.680 --> 13:09.730
I've invited the representatives
of all three races here.

13:09.730 --> 13:11.850
I thought we were supposed to go to them.

13:11.850 --> 13:14.360
Inviting them over seems
somewhat condescending.

13:14.900 --> 13:17.610
They really look forward to moving here.

13:18.230 --> 13:20.780
It's only right for them
to send their representatives.

13:20.780 --> 13:23.170
Ms. Emma, you're scaring me.

13:23.660 --> 13:26.160
Young Master, this is a great chance.

13:26.160 --> 13:29.290
And please, stop calling me miss!

13:29.750 --> 13:30.960
But...

13:31.830 --> 13:33.920
OVERWHELMING AURA
Display your authority.

13:33.920 --> 13:37.380
OVERWHELMING AURA
Her overwhelming aura made me speechless.

13:37.380 --> 13:39.340
FIRST GROUP: WING-KIN
RECOMMENDED BY SHIKI

13:40.010 --> 13:43.300
Welcome to the Subspace.

13:43.840 --> 13:45.390
It's an honor.

13:45.390 --> 13:50.770
Thank you for inviting us
to relocate to this wonderful land.

13:51.160 --> 13:53.230
I am Makoto Misumi.

13:53.230 --> 13:55.230
I am kind of the baron here.

13:55.520 --> 13:57.610
I am the Wing-kin elder,

13:57.610 --> 13:58.980
Kakun.

13:59.780 --> 14:01.240
She is my aide, Shona.

14:01.900 --> 14:03.700
Pleasure meeting you, Master Makoto.

14:03.990 --> 14:05.160
And?

14:05.160 --> 14:07.450
How long do you intend to be in the air?

14:07.990 --> 14:10.080
My... My apologies.

14:10.080 --> 14:11.410
She is scary.

14:11.910 --> 14:13.420
Let's see.

14:14.580 --> 14:17.420
You have quite a population.

14:17.420 --> 14:19.760
I didn't think so many
would be living in a land

14:19.760 --> 14:21.920
even more remote than Tomoe's mountain.

14:22.550 --> 14:26.890
It's remote,
but the land is very fertile.

14:26.890 --> 14:28.180
I see.

14:28.180 --> 14:31.640
Have you always defended your own home?

14:31.640 --> 14:32.690
Yes.

14:32.690 --> 14:35.730
We take pride in our combat strength.

14:35.730 --> 14:39.150
Now, about the migration process...

14:39.440 --> 14:43.610
Can we even be as capable
as those who came before us

14:43.610 --> 14:46.990
and be assigned jobs
that match our skills?

14:46.990 --> 14:48.700
Yes. That's the plan here.

14:49.240 --> 14:50.620
I still can't believe it.

14:51.390 --> 14:53.470
We are actually going to live
on this vast land

14:53.470 --> 14:55.580
without having to fight for resources!

14:56.500 --> 14:58.040
How awkward.

14:58.040 --> 15:00.550
WING-KIN: PASSED

15:00.550 --> 15:01.710
SECOND GROUP: GORGON
RECOMMENDED BY TOMOE

15:01.710 --> 15:02.510
Eng...

15:03.340 --> 15:05.340
Sorry to say this as soon as we meet,

15:05.340 --> 15:07.760
but can you remove your blindfolds?

15:08.140 --> 15:11.140
But our eyes...

15:11.140 --> 15:13.230
have a powerful petrification effect.

15:13.570 --> 15:14.770
Gorgons.

15:14.770 --> 15:15.940
In my world,

15:15.940 --> 15:18.690
they are known as Medusa.

15:19.270 --> 15:21.320
I'll be fine.

15:21.320 --> 15:23.740
Emma is under my protection as well.

15:23.740 --> 15:28.200
But I can't sense
any flow of mana on you.

15:28.910 --> 15:32.160
Are you looking down on my master?

15:33.700 --> 15:34.500
Very well.

15:39.750 --> 15:42.500
The petrification effect
is indeed very strong.

15:43.090 --> 15:45.010
Must be some kind of Devil Eyes.

15:45.010 --> 15:47.510
This power must have
made life very inconvenient.

15:47.510 --> 15:48.720
Yes.

15:48.720 --> 15:50.800
Even food gets turned into stone.

15:51.350 --> 15:53.180
Based on the file I have,

15:53.180 --> 15:55.560
there are only women in your kind.

15:55.980 --> 15:56.850
Yes.

15:57.390 --> 16:02.820
We used to reproduce by draining
the life force of other races.

16:03.110 --> 16:05.780
EXCITED
Blindfolded and draining life force...

16:06.570 --> 16:09.780
The offspring will be gorgon.

16:09.780 --> 16:13.240
We've been trying very hard
for the continuity of our kind.

16:13.240 --> 16:15.700
EXCITED
Blind... Blindfolded...

16:16.000 --> 16:17.330
Young Master?

16:17.330 --> 16:18.460
So...

16:19.170 --> 16:20.670
Until you move here,

16:20.670 --> 16:23.920
as we can't find you partners,

16:23.920 --> 16:26.590
you'll have to settle it on your own.

16:26.590 --> 16:27.670
Of course.

16:28.340 --> 16:32.430
I wonder if the others here
can withstand our petrifying eyes.

16:32.890 --> 16:34.610
That won't be a problem.

16:35.060 --> 16:39.390
I'll make glasses with the same
shielding effect as your blindfolds.

16:39.810 --> 16:41.100
Really?

16:41.730 --> 16:42.980
Ye... Yes.

16:42.980 --> 16:47.070
Now, onto the sharing of knowledge
and combat training,

16:48.200 --> 16:50.200
city development, and other tasks.

16:50.200 --> 16:54.530
If you agree to participate,
then all is well.

16:54.990 --> 16:57.580
Thank you so much!

16:57.580 --> 16:58.500
But...

16:58.870 --> 17:01.540
Are you sure you want us here?

17:01.540 --> 17:05.960
Once an object is turned into stone,
the effect can't be reversed.

17:06.760 --> 17:08.510
I should be able to restore anything.

17:08.510 --> 17:09.680
That won't be a problem.

17:11.890 --> 17:13.099
Let's see...

17:13.640 --> 17:14.369
Like so.

17:18.520 --> 17:21.520
I see. I should add an anti-petrification
property to it too.

17:22.020 --> 17:22.950
Well then...

17:25.569 --> 17:28.440
It didn't turn back into stone!
Incredible!

17:29.020 --> 17:32.470
We thought we'd have to wear
blindfolds forever and almost gave up.

17:32.910 --> 17:34.370
Master Makoto!

17:35.450 --> 17:37.660
Please let us move here!

17:38.290 --> 17:39.710
Please.

17:41.670 --> 17:44.710
As long as you don't have affairs

17:44.710 --> 17:47.090
or start any love triangles.

17:47.550 --> 17:50.550
If you can't get used
to living with your partners,

17:50.820 --> 17:53.510
you can try having a one-night stand.

17:55.010 --> 17:56.930
I must have lost my mind.

17:56.930 --> 17:59.470
GORGON: PASSED

17:59.470 --> 18:00.680
THIRD GROUP: AL-ELEMERA
RECOMMENDED BY MIO

18:00.680 --> 18:01.440
In other words,

18:01.790 --> 18:05.770
the forest where you fairies lived
was discovered by a group of liches.

18:05.770 --> 18:07.400
Is that why you seek shelter here?

18:07.700 --> 18:08.940
We are not fairies!

18:08.940 --> 18:10.320
We are Al-Elemera!

18:10.320 --> 18:12.400
We are much more noble than those bugs.

18:12.400 --> 18:13.990
My... My apologies.

18:15.490 --> 18:18.830
We are between fairies and spirits.

18:18.830 --> 18:21.620
We can even command lesser spirits.

18:21.620 --> 18:23.120
We're good at collecting honey!

18:23.420 --> 18:25.580
We can even communicate with one another.

18:28.550 --> 18:30.800
How dare you do that
in front of the Young Master?

18:30.800 --> 18:33.260
Why did Lady Mio
even recommend these creatures?

18:33.260 --> 18:34.390
It's all right.

18:34.390 --> 18:37.510
They are large in number, but they'll
come in handy for explorations.

18:38.230 --> 18:39.220
Given their tiny size.

18:39.550 --> 18:40.600
You can count on us.

18:40.600 --> 18:42.770
We are the brave Al-Elemera.

18:42.770 --> 18:44.190
Get ready to move...

18:45.400 --> 18:46.690
I object!

18:48.860 --> 18:52.610
There will be trouble if we let
these hot-headed creatures live here!

18:52.610 --> 18:53.860
Ms. Emma?

18:54.430 --> 18:55.320
Miss?

18:56.280 --> 18:58.330
This is an interview!

18:58.330 --> 19:00.240
The entire race's future is at stake.

19:00.240 --> 19:02.750
This is not the attitude
a representative should show!

19:02.750 --> 19:04.540
Calm down.
That's enough.

19:04.540 --> 19:06.040
No! I'll say it!

19:06.040 --> 19:08.250
You are too kind to them.

19:08.620 --> 19:10.500
What Al-Elemera?

19:10.500 --> 19:13.260
Why should I care
if you're between a fairy and a spirit?

19:13.260 --> 19:16.720
If you're so great, figure out
how to fend off the liches yourselves!

19:17.970 --> 19:19.550
What? Who do you think you are?

19:19.550 --> 19:21.060
Yeah, you're just a pig.

19:22.020 --> 19:24.980
FILLING UP WITH RAGE
I beg your pardon?

19:24.980 --> 19:27.350
I'll toss you into birdcages!

19:27.350 --> 19:29.650
You should get destroyed
along with your forest!

19:29.650 --> 19:31.610
Cursed insects!

19:32.150 --> 19:34.150
Emma! Calm down!

19:34.150 --> 19:36.200
AL-ELEMERA: KIV
Emma! Calm down! Please!

19:39.120 --> 19:41.660
It's a lot cooler tonight.

19:41.660 --> 19:44.910
Two of the races passed the interview.

19:44.910 --> 19:47.670
I'll try crafting the glasses
and contact lenses

19:47.670 --> 19:49.960
the gorgons need.

19:49.960 --> 19:55.670
I'll handle the Wing-kin and come up
with some training routines.

19:56.090 --> 19:57.880
I'm counting on you.

19:58.300 --> 19:59.890
But more importantly,

19:59.890 --> 20:02.350
why did Mio bring
those strange creatures here?

20:02.660 --> 20:03.690
Young Master.

20:04.640 --> 20:06.850
Try this out.

20:07.600 --> 20:09.350
Vege sticks and...

20:10.630 --> 20:12.400
Is that mayonnaise?

20:12.400 --> 20:13.610
Did you make that?

20:13.610 --> 20:14.230
Yes.

20:14.570 --> 20:15.950
I gave the recipe a try.

20:17.070 --> 20:18.530
Here goes nothing.

20:23.030 --> 20:24.240
I've missed this taste.

20:24.240 --> 20:25.330
Well done, Mio.

20:27.790 --> 20:29.880
So, this is mayonnaise.

20:29.880 --> 20:32.790
Lady Mio, can I have some too?

20:32.790 --> 20:35.760
Fine. Be sure to savor it.

20:37.420 --> 20:40.220
The sourness, and layering,
and the savouriness...

20:40.220 --> 20:41.720
It has a complex taste.

20:42.680 --> 20:45.640
I wonder if we can use this in hotpot.

20:45.640 --> 20:46.930
Mayonnaise hotpot?

20:48.770 --> 20:52.400
This thing is no match
for the miso I'm developing.

20:52.770 --> 20:57.360
I'm working extra hard to recreate the flavors
because you can't make miso.

20:57.360 --> 20:59.740
Hurry up so I can start
making miso soups.

20:59.740 --> 21:01.820
It's almost there.

21:02.780 --> 21:06.660
I bet Tomoe would love
miso cucumber salad.

21:11.750 --> 21:14.210
The new immigrants have arrived
in the Subspace.

21:14.790 --> 21:16.880
Meanwhile, at the academy city,

21:16.880 --> 21:19.720
there are rumors about
new students making a return.

21:20.220 --> 21:21.680
Hey, did you hear?

21:22.430 --> 21:24.890
Those two are coming back next week.

21:25.260 --> 21:26.850
Those two?

21:26.850 --> 21:27.850
Seriously?

21:28.160 --> 21:30.310
Are they healed?

21:31.270 --> 21:34.650
No one knows
if they were even sick.

21:35.320 --> 21:38.610
Your typical obnoxious type of tycoons.

21:39.070 --> 21:41.490
But their grades are good,

21:41.490 --> 21:43.290
which makes them even more nasty.

21:43.290 --> 21:48.290
Not just the students, they've managed
to bring down even the lecturers.

21:49.120 --> 21:51.040
Does Mr. Kuzunoha know about this?

21:51.620 --> 21:54.300
He is new here,
so probably not.

21:54.300 --> 21:56.420
Those two only go for
the good-looking ones.

21:56.420 --> 21:58.510
I think he is safe.

21:59.090 --> 22:01.010
The Rembrandt sisters.

22:01.010 --> 22:03.220
Let's hope they don't bring
too much trouble.

23:35.480 --> 23:39.690
NEXT EPISODE: THE NOTORIOUS SISTERS
Night 8: "The Notorious Sisters."
